{"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/stressMajorizationLayout(initial:edgeLength:tolerance:maxIterations:)"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"metadata":{"title":"stressMajorizationLayout(initial:edgeLength:tolerance:maxIterations:)","externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P0A7DrawingE24stressMajorizationLayout7initial10edgeLength9tolerance13maxIterationsAD0C0Vy6VertexQzGANSg_Sd5Edges_5IndexQZXESdSitF","modules":[{"relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"],"name":"GraphDrawing"}],"symbolKind":"method","extendedModule":"GraphProtocols","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"stressMajorizationLayout","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"initial","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Drawing","preciseIdentifier":"s:12GraphDrawing0B0V","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"edgeLength","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Edges","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5EdgesQa","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Index","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Double","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"tolerance","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Double","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"maxIterations","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Drawing","preciseIdentifier":"s:12GraphDrawing0B0V","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/GraphDrawing\/StressMajorizationLayout.swift#L33","fileName":"StressMajorizationLayout.swift"},"roleHeading":"Instance Method","role":"symbol"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"stressMajorizationLayout","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"initial","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Drawing","preciseIdentifier":"s:12GraphDrawing0B0V","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/Drawing","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">? = nil, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"edgeLength","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Edges","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5EdgesQa","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Edges-swift.associatedtype","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Index","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Double","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = { _ in 1 }, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"tolerance","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Double","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = 1e-5, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"maxIterations","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = 1000) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Drawing","preciseIdentifier":"s:12GraphDrawing0B0V","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/Drawing","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The target distance d_ij of two vertices is their shortest-path distance with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"edgeLength"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(hops by default); between components it is 1 + L̄·√n, L̄ the mean edge length (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"neato"},{"text":"‘s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"rule without packing). The drawing minimizes the stress Σ_{i<j} d_ij⁻² (‖x_i − x_j‖ − d_ij)²,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"which with these weights is Kamada and Kawai’s energy. Each step updates every vertex in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"text":" order to the minimizer of a majorant of the stress in that vertex (Gansner,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Koren and North’s localized update), so the stress never increases. The run stops one step","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"after a step that lowered the stress by at most ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"tolerance"},{"text":" times its value (each step","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"measures its starting stress on the way), or after ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxIterations"},{"text":" steps.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The start is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"initial"},{"type":"text","text":", or by default "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"circularLayout(radius: L̄)"},{"type":"text","text":", NetworkX’s start for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Kamada–Kawai scaled by the mean edge length (Graphviz’s practice), so that scaling every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"length scales the drawing. Deterministic: no randomness anywhere. A directed graph is drawn"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"through "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"undirected"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Gansner, Koren and North, “Graph drawing by stress majorization”, Graph Drawing (GD"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"2004), LNCS 3383, 2005."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Kamada and Kawai, “An algorithm for drawing general undirected graphs”, Information"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Processing Letters 31(1), 1989."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"O(n·(n + m)) for the distances by breadth-first search (O(n·m log n) by Dijkstra when the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"lengths differ), then O(n²) per step; O(n²) memory, so for graphs up to about 10⁴","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"vertices.","type":"text"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every edge length is positive and finite; "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"tolerance ≥ 0"},{"type":"text","text":";"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxIterations ≥ 0"},{"type":"text","text":"; every vertex of the graph is in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"initial"},{"type":"text","text":" when it is given."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Precondition","style":"note","type":"aside"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing","doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/GraphProtocols","doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/GraphProtocols\/Graph"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/graphdrawing\/graphprotocols\/graph\/stressmajorizationlayout(initial:edgelength:tolerance:maxiterations:)"]}],"abstract":[{"text":"A drawing whose distances match the graph’s: stress majorization, the minimizer of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Kamada and Kawai’s energy that Graphviz’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"neato"},{"text":" uses by default.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://GraphDrawing/documentation/GraphDrawing/GraphProtocols/Graph/stressMajorizationLayout(initial:edgeLength:tolerance:maxIterations:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/stressMajorizationLayout(initial:edgeLength:tolerance:maxIterations:)","kind":"symbol","title":"stressMajorizationLayout(initial:edgeLength:tolerance:maxIterations:)","url":"\/documentation\/graphdrawing\/graphprotocols\/graph\/stressmajorizationlayout(initial:edgelength:tolerance:maxiterations:)","abstract":[{"text":"A drawing whose distances match the graph’s: stress majorization, the minimizer of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Kamada and Kawai’s energy that Graphviz’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"neato","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" uses by default.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"stressMajorizationLayout","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"initial","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Dr